        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fbfbf9;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 556px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 22px 24px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: #fdfdfb;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 4px 0 20px 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .head-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .check {\n    color: #f06ea9;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n  }\n  .name {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #111;\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, #fff59a 62%);\n    padding: 0 1px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .stars {\n    color: #f7a8cd;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .stars.n5 { color: #f9b6d6; }\n  .desc {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    margin: 0 0 0 26px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .u {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 82%, #7fd8f2 82%, #7fd8f2 96%, transparent 96%);\n  }\n  .u-pink {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 82%, #f9a8cf 82%, #f9a8cf 96%, transparent 96%);\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #d9b3c8;\n    color: #b3627f;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(255,240,248,0.35);\n  }\n  .handwrite-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    margin: -6px 40px 2px 0;\n  }\n  .handwrite {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 34px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"doc-title\">本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">马房湾 66 号江湖菜</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">非常出名的重庆江湖菜，味道超级地道，推荐江湖第一蒸，辣子鸡、招牌血旺<span class=\"u\">等</span>，环境是七八十年代怀旧风，集颜值与味道于一身的江湖菜</p>\n    <div class=\"handwrite-wrap\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder handwrite\" style=\"margin:0;\">[手写批注: 右侧「重庆江湖菜切1」]</figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">洋马儿火锅</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\"><span class=\"u\">一家藏得很深的火锅，很正宗的九宫格火锅</span>，九宫格上面放着鹅卵石，虾滑、毛肚超好吃</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">君之薇火锅</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">这是一家藏在半山腰上的火锅店已经有 20 多年历史了，味道还是那么霸道，重点是还便宜，性价比越高，冰汤圆和卤味系列的菜是我的最爱，他们家包子还超好吃</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">六指烧烤</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">烧烤店也能排队排到心累，碳火考出来的烧烤真的太香了，特别喜欢烤豆干，里面放一些他们家的泡萝卜，好吃到哭</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">沈姐烤鱼</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\"><span class=\"u\">很正宗的重庆万州烤鱼</span>，就在重庆大学 B 区，烤鱼有多钟味道，最爱吃的还是香辣味，性价比很高，一大条鱼才几十块钱的样子</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">熨斗糕老烧饼</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">在较场口的梯坎上，在繁华的大都市中，买上一只只卖 5 毛钱的熨斗糕满满的童年回忆，Q弹软嫩，烧饼也很好吃，价格也很感人！</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">望江楼三鲜砂锅米线</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">虽然比较远，但是真的是跟度假一样，到这里安静，淳朴！<span class=\"u\">藏在大山上 25 年的砂锅米线</span>，一排灶凡可同时煮很多砂锅，每一位料都非常丰富，鲜香四溢！</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">食济粮重庆特产严选超市</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">重庆买特产的好去处，是连锁店，正规不会被坑，他们家的<span class=\"u-pink\">上下城火锅底料还不错</span>，作为本地人都经常买来煮火锅</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head-row\">\n      <span class=\"check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">老院子肥肠鸡</span>\n      <span class=\"stars\">★★★★</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"desc\">这家店在老居民楼的坝坝里，每天人都是爆满，他们家的肥肠鸡非常入味，滴着油的肥肠柔韧又有弹性，口感很不错</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
